	"notice": "Connect USB TO HOST to a computer or use the supplied MIDI breakout cable. Set MIDI channel, Local Control and MIDI Control as described in the manual. Supply batteries or the specified DC adapter; USB is not the instrument power source. This profile does not reuse reface CS controller mappings. Exact browser MIDI port names are not verified; select this profile manually. The selected-control schematics are illustrative. Keys and panel controls remain unbound because channel, octave, mode and assignable functions must be checked against the instrument setup. This is a partial hardware and setup profile, not a complete MIDI implementation.",
